                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">In this example, we create set of random spheres.
For each sphere, we store as attributes its radius and distance to origin.
We use the ShapeDiver Output component to create geometry 
that is compatible with the attributes visualization feature of the viewer.</item>
