              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">ffd2178e-aac0-43ad-b91a-517800485f82</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Use the ShapeDiver Output component</item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Like the Display components, the ShapeDiver Output component can be used to define output geometry which can be visualized in the online viewer.
However, it is the online component able to store and transfer custom attributes for each geometry asset in the scene.
It needs to be used every time attribute visualization is required.</item>
